      "note": "ServingCollaborators and _ServingRuntime newly declare optional review_memory_root defaulting to None. ReviewMemoryRootPort is only a callable type alias. The projection stream route explicitly passes the runtime field to multiplex_review_memory. That helper skips root resolution for absent review identity, validates supplied selectors, resolves the port and reports missing adapter/root errors. The native worker enforces its own root-shape checks. These bodies do not prove the composition root's full leaf-admission policy.\n\nAnchor: inclusive source ranges",
